{"id":"letrero","lemma":"letrero","pos":"noun","rank":4779,"glosses":["sign, signboard, signpost"],"ipa":"/leˈtɾeɾo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"letreros"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-letrero.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Qué dice ese letrero?","en":"What does this sign say?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/524394","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to say","l":"decir"},{"g":"that"},null]},{"text":"¿Qué significa este letrero?","en":"What does this sign mean?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to signify","l":"significar"},{"g":"this"},null]},{"text":"Soy miope, así que no puedo leer ese letrero.","en":"I'm near-sighted, so I can't read that sign.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/871985","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"myopic"},null,null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to read"},{"g":"that"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"so, therefore"]]},{"text":"La mayoría de los letreros están escritos en inglés.","en":"Most signs are written in English.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"majority"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"a writing, a writ","l":"escrito"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"English"}]},{"text":"Los letreros donde dice \"alta tensión\" frecuentemente son amarillos.","en":"Signs that say \"high voltage\" are often yellow.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"by, near to"},{"g":"to say","l":"decir"},null,null,{"g":"often, frequently"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"yellow or golden","l":"amarillo"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"high tension"]]}]}